OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy and dry into the
OL,7,Fevening. A cool night follows with
OL,8,Fcloud building from the west
OL,9,Fovernight. Patchy rain arrives by dawn
OL,10,Fwith winds freshening later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy and damp through the
OL,13,Fmorning with light rain across the
OL,14,Fregion. Rain becoming patchy through
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Fresh winds.
OL,16,FTemperatures above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
